  "title": "Average per Group",
  "type": "function",
  "difficulty": "medium",
  "description": "Write `class_averages(rows)` where each row is `{'class': '7A', 'marks': 88}`. Return a dictionary mapping each class to its average marks (rounded to 2 decimals), with classes in alphabetical order. Use `groupby`.",
  "starter_code": "import pandas as pd\n\ndef class_averages(rows):\n    # Write your code here\n    pass\n",
